          "heading": "使い始めるには",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            { "text": "Copilot ライセンスと、Copilot 有効の Teams 会議ポリシーがあれば自動的に利用可能", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/microsoftteams/intelligent-recap-without-saving-transcripts", "locator": "有効にする", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-21T01:10:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "開催者は会議前に [会議オプション] でオン/オフを切り替える", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/microsoftteams/intelligent-recap-without-saving-transcripts", "locator": "有効にする", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-21T01:10:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "開催者・共同開催者・発表者は、会議中も会議コントロールで切り替えられる", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/microsoftteams/intelligent-recap-without-saving-transcripts", "locator": "有効にする", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-21T01:10:00Z" }] }
